>\'ậ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ẩ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ẫ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">,</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ă\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ằ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ắ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ặ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ẳ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'ẵ\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'a\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">,</span></div><div><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'è\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'e\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\">, </span><span style=\"color: #ce9178;\">\'é\'</span><span style=\"color: #d4d4d4;\"> =&gt; </span><span sty